r!\nRepurpose discarded materials into valued equipment through an innovative new crafting system, whether it\u2019s upcycling an old tire into a flower planter or crafting unique furniture from reclaimed wood!\nMaster sustainable farming techniques like hydroponics, aquaponics, and trellis farming. Craft your own tools using renewable energy generated from the sun, wind and rain!\nCreate a character that reflects your own personal style and design your home in your favorite aesthetic\u2014whether it\u2019s Y2K, Goth, or something uniquely yours. Add a personal touch by crafting organic paints and dyes to color your items just the way you like!\nRescue and adopt animals to join you on your journey\u2014from capybaras and turtles, to endangered species and more. You\u2019ll even be able to dress them up in cute outfits!\nWhether you\u2019re exploring, building, or simply unwinding with friends, Loftia offers countless opportunities for fun, creativity, and meaningful connections for everyone.", "summary": "Welcome to Loftia, a cozy, multiplayer world where you can build towards a brighter, more sustainable future! Connect with friends both old and new, to farm, craft, explore, decorate, and create a meaningful impact - together.", "themes": [{"id": 33, "name": "Sandbox"}, {"id": 34, "name": "Educational"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/loftia", "videos": [{"id": 91697, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "LDK-Zk7NHqM", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LDK-Zk7NHqM", "title": "Loftia | Wholesome Direct 2023 Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/LDK-Zk7NHqM/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 135137, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "MescIkCogaI", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MescIkCogaI", "title": "Loftia Neighborhoods Trailer | Wholesome Snack 2024", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/MescIkCogaI/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 159363, "name": "Teaser", "video_id": "KGXWQXu97Iw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KGXWQXu97Iw", "title": "Loftia Hanging Gar